{
    "_comment": [
        "Capability evidence patterns.",
        "",
        "framework/config/semantic_patterns.json defines scoring patterns for 21 of",
        "the 28 concepts in mappings.json. Seven concepts exist in the canonical",
        "schema and in mappings.json but have no scoring pattern, so they can never",
        "be inferred today. Four of them are exactly the evidence the ESCALATION,",
        "INCIDENT_RESPONSE, INVESTIGATION and OPERATIONAL_DISCIPLINE capabilities",
        "need:",
        "",
        "    RESOLUTION_TIME  -> response_context.resolution_time",
        "    ESCALATION_STATUS-> response_context.escalation_status",
        "    EVENT_TIMESTAMP  -> alert_context.timestamp",
        "    USER_IDENTIFIER  -> entity_context.entity_name",
        "",
        "This file adds scoring patterns for those EXISTING concepts only. It",
        "introduces no new canonical concept, and it is scored by the existing",
        "framework.intelligence.semantic_inference.SemanticInference engine, so",
        "discovery behaves identically to the main mapping pass.",
        "",
        "It is read ONLY by framework.capability. The main semantic mapping pass is",
        "not modified, so result['semantic_mapping'], result['dataset_context'] and",
        "result['mapping_report'] are unchanged.",
        "",
        "Negative keywords mirror the guards already implemented in",
        "framework.mapping.schema_mapper.SchemaMapper.validate_mapping: an opening",
        "or creation time must never be read as a resolution time, and a person who",
        "closed something is not a resolution time."
    ],


    "RESOLUTION_TIME": {

        "keywords": [
            "resolution_time",
            "resolution_timestamp",
            "resolved_time",
            "resolved_at",
            "closed_time",
            "closed_at",
            "closure_time",
            "closure_timestamp",
            "remediation_time",
            "time_to_resolve",
            "ttR",
            "closed_date"
        ],

        "negative_keywords": [
            "closed_by",
            "created",
            "opened",
            "open_time",
            "acknowledged",
            "ack_time",
            "elapsed",
            "duration",
            "timeout",
            "lifetime",
            "age"
        ],

        "expected_categories": [
            "numeric",
            "identifier_like",
            "datetime",
            "categorical"
        ]
    },


    "ESCALATION_STATUS": {

